# {{ project_title }}

This project was generated by `python -m microsys startproject` and already follows the MicroSys baseline.

## First Run

1. Review and edit `.secrets/.env` before first boot.
2. Install your dependencies.
3. Run `python manage.py migrate`.
4. Run `python manage.py microsys_setup --skip-configure`.
5. Start the server and sign in as a superuser.
6. Complete `/sys/setup/`.

